# MASON `infra/docker` layout (fixed)

**Never** flatten `infra/docker/cue/` into `infra/docker/` root.

```
infra/
  proto/cue/infra.cue      ← #DockerParams + Rice docker.rice contract (Mint schema)
  proto/schema/            ← committed Mint/terraform schemas (not CHIEF snapshots)
  gen/                     ← generated only (gitignore); Mint writes chief/docker_project.cue
  docker/
    _tool.cue              ← cue cmd genDocker (writes .docker/)
    cue/pack.cue           ← params, paths, allFiles roll-up
    cue/schema.cue         ← re-export infra.#DockerParams
    cue/defaults.cue       ← _masonDefaults (CHIEF/Mint override)
    cue/*.cue              ← platform emit templates
```

**CHIEF** = `custom/<slug>/bowl` (`[package] infra = ""`) + `custom/<slug>/infra/docker.rice` (`use infra as docker` + `rc docker let`).

```ini
# bowl — declares infra syntax package ("" = workspace MASON schema)
[package]
infra = ""

# docker.rice — imports facet from that package
use infra as docker
rc docker let { ... }
```

**Generate** (`CHIEF_PROJECT` required):

```bash
export CHIEF_PROJECT=egos.app
cargo run -p mint --bin mint_overlay_check -- --apply-docker
cue cmd gen ./infra/_tool.cue
```

Vet/gen load: `docker/_tool.cue`, `docker/cue/**`, `gen/chief/docker_project.cue` (proto via import).
